    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="07470023-f17a-50f5-b30c-1c47d38dc71d" activityNameId="4fa6c316-f6f8-5425-8dea-b491aef33e89" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilation equipment, decentralized, 180-250 m3</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ventilation equipment, decentralized, 180-250 m3
Disposal of the ventilation unit for decentral ventilation systems with 120 m3/h average air flow. Average of four different ventilation units with 180-250 m3/h maximal air flow considered. Housing mainly made of galvanised steel. Total weight of component 43.1 kg;
UUID: 41a3c3a0-ed41-4590-8f00-ed8bb47b5420
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces and copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_41a3c3a0-ed41-4590-8f00-ed8bb47b5420.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
